# PocketPic Web on R2

- The web app is `website/` served by the Cloudflare Worker in `worker/src/index.ts` (`wrangler.jsonc`). Netlify static hosting cannot run `/api`, so it will not sync.
- Photos live in the R2 bucket `pocketpic`, reached only through the Worker's R2 binding. IndexedDB is a per-device cache.
- Lock is a **passphrase**, not a passkey. Its SHA-256 hash is stored at `auth/passphrase.json` in the bucket so every device shares it. Sessions are an HttpOnly cookie signed with that hash.
- Never put R2 access keys or the passphrase in the client, settings UI, or git. No browser SigV4, no bucket CORS setup.
- Index of photos is `index/photos.json`, written with an ETag precondition.
